    "# Clustering : \n",
    "- It is an unsupervised ML technique that automatically group similar, unlabeled data points into clusters based on defined similarity metrics.\n",
    "### It is 3 types\n",
    "- Partitioning Labels -> KMeans Clustering\n",
    "- Hierarchial Clustering\n",
    "- Density Based -> DBSCAN"
   ]
